Correct, first rendu step-um sariya sonna 👏 Adutha varisai idho:

① catalyst.json → "entry_api nu oru cook irukkaar" ✅ (nee sonnadhu)

② .catalystrc → "idhu my-vehicle-app-2 hotel" ✅ (nee sonnadhu)

③ functions/entry_api/catalyst-config.json → cook oda ID card. Idhu un file la irukkuradhu:
"name": "entry_api",
"stack": "node20",        ← cook Node 20 la dhaan samaipaar
"type": "advancedio",     ← (req, res) style cook
"main": "index.js"        ← cook-a "index.js" la dhaan koopidanum

④ functions/entry_api/index.js → cook ready ah nu paakkum (file irukka, module.exports irukka)

⑤ functions/entry_api/node_modules/ → kitchen tools (zcatalyst-sdk-node) irukka nu paakkum

⑥ Port 3000 la server start → kadhavu open, waiter counter la nikkaraar. Terminal la ippadi varum:
http://localhost:3000/server/entry_api/

⑦ Wait → customer (browser) order podura varaikkum summa nikkum.

catalyst serve
  ① catalyst.json            → yaar yaar cook?          (entry_api)
  ② .catalystrc              → endha hotel?             (my-vehicle-app-2)
  ③ catalyst-config.json     → cook ID card             (node20, advancedio, index.js)
  ④ index.js                 → cook ready?
  ⑤ node_modules             → tools ready?
  ⑥ port 3000 open           → waiter ready
  ⑦ wait...                  → order kaaga

Ippo neeye paaru, terminal la idhu nadakkudha nu:
catalyst serve
___________________________________________________________________




catalyst serve kudutha udane, hotel open aagura varisai idhu dhaan:

1. 🔑 Manager hotel ku varaar (catalyst serve command start aagudhu)

2. 📒 Register book paakkuraar (catalyst.json padikkum)

▎ "Indha hotel la entry_api nu oru cook irukkaar"

3. 🪪 Hotel endha company nu paakkuraar (.catalystrc padikkum)

▎ "Idhu my-vehicle-app-2 hotel, zoho account"

4. 🍳 Cook ready ah nu check panraar (functions/entry_api/ la index.js + node_modules irukka nu paakkum)

5. 🚪 Kadhavu open, waiter counter la nikkaraar (port 3000 la server start aagum)

▎ Terminal la ippadi varum: http://localhost:3000/server/entry_api/

6. 🧍 Waiter wait panraar. Customer varra varaikkum edhuvum nadakkaadhu. Terminal summa nikkum, adhu normal.

Ippo customer vandhaa:

7. 🙋 Nee plate la (browser) order podura → localhost:3000/server/entry_api/ open pannura

8. 🧑‍🍳 Waiter order-a cook kitta kudukkuraar → index.js run aagudhu (req, res) vechu

9. 🥞 Cook dosai suduraar → res.write('Hello...')

10. 🍽️ Waiter plate la vechu kudukkuraar → Browser la "Hello from index.js" theriyum

